cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these result tables, please cite the manuscript and this archive."
title: "Auditing gene-regulatory prior delivery and decoder response in single-cell variational autoencoders"
abstract: >-
  Reference code, audit package, figure generators, and curated result tables
  for the V49 study of gene-regulatory prior delivery in single-cell variational
  autoencoders. The archive includes the 33-configuration audit, the 73-fit
  PG-UNAGI delivered-prior experiment, and Gaussian and ZINB cross-architecture
  replications.
